 !                                                                               
 ! This test calculates the SCF energy of                                        
 ! F atom in D2h employing valence-only Hamitonian                               
 ! for effective-core-potentials.                                                
 ! Note the keyword .ECP in **GENERAL.                                           
 !                                                                               
 **DIRAC                                                                         
 .TITLE                                                                          
 F atom D2h                                                                      
 .WAVE F                                                                         
 **GENERAL                                                                       
 .ECP                                                                            
 .DIRECT                                                                         
 1 1 1                                                                           
 **INTEGRALS                                                                     
 *TWOINT                                                                         
 .SOFOCK                                                                         
 .SCREEN                                                                         
 1.0D-12                                                                         
 **WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                
 .DHF                                                                            
 *DHFCAL                                                                         
 .CLOSED SHELL                                                                   
 2 0                                                                             
 .OPEN SHELL                                                                     
 1                                                                               
 5/0,6                                                                           
 .INTFLG                                                                         
 1 1 1                                                                           
 .MAXITR                                                                         
 200                                                                             
 .EVCCNV                                                                         
 1.0E-8                                                                          
 .CNVINT                                                                         
 0.01 0.0001                                                                     
 *END OF DIRAC                                                                   
                                                                                 


